\[\hat{\pi}_{t}=\pi_{t}-\overline{\pi}_{S_{t}=i};\;\;k=\{1,2,3\}\]

 avec : \(\pi_{t}=\varphi_{0,S_{t}}=k+\varphi_{1}\pi_{t}-1+\varphi_{2}\pi_{t}-2+\epsilon _{t};\;\epsilon_{t}\sim NID\left(0,\sigma_{S_{t}}^{2}=k\right)\)

